# Keeper Idrenna of Oskett (docs/world/07-mvp-slice.md). One conversation for the whole quest:
# the opening depends on the Eastern Road quest's state and on whether she was turned down before.
~ start
if QuestManager.is_quest_complete("clear_eastern_road")
	=> farewell
elif QuestManager.get_quest_stage("clear_eastern_road") == "return_to_keeper"
	=> report
elif QuestManager.is_quest_active("clear_eastern_road")
	Idrenna: Still walking, are they? Then so should you.
	=> END
elif QuestManager.get_flag("idrenna_turned_down")
	Idrenna: Orders change, soldier?
	=> offer
Idrenna: They sent one of you, then. One.
- What's the trouble? => offer
- Just on patrol. => farewell

~ offer
Idrenna: The dead are walking your road again. Will you put them down?
- I'll see to it.
	$> QuestManager.start_quest("clear_eastern_road")
	Idrenna: Walk soft past the barrows. They listen.
- Not in my orders.
	$> QuestManager.set_flag("idrenna_turned_down")
	=> farewell
=> END

~ farewell
Idrenna: Keep your feet dry, soldier.
=> END

~ report
Idrenna: You came back. More than most.
- The road's quiet.
- For now.
$> QuestManager.complete_quest("clear_eastern_road")
Idrenna: This was my son's. Your Throne paid him and sent him south. It should keep someone dry.
Idrenna: The Choir's louder since they opened it. Don't go down there alone.
=> END
